{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies a modifier to indicate if this Scene can be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when creating a new Scene for the received External Event."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"conditions","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This modifier is only supported for WindowGroup Scene types.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For DocumentGroups, the received External Event must have a URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the DocumentGroup to be considered. (Either via openURL, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the webPageURL property of an NSUserActivity). The UTI for the URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is implicitly matched against the DocumentGroup’s supported types.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the modifier evaluates to true, an instance of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Scene will be used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to false, on macOS the Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will not be used even if no other Scenes are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is considered an error. On iOS, the first Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified in the body property for the App will be used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If no modifier is set, the Scene will be used if all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other WindowGroups with a modifier evaluate to false."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that only allow a single Window\/Scene, this method is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}],"title":"ModifiedContent"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","abstract":[{"text":"Specifies a modifier to indicate if this Scene can be used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when creating a new Scene for the received External Event.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"url":"\/document